1
00:01:48,560 --> 00:01:49,359
Hello,

2
00:01:49,760 --> 00:01:50,719
General Walter.

3
00:01:51,400 --> 00:01:53,560
This is Antilocaris Hospital.

4
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:57,400
I'm the one running this lockdown.

5
00:01:58,560 --> 00:02:00,799
I advise you not to harm anyone in the hospital.

6
00:02:03,079 --> 00:02:03,879
Xavier's

7
00:02:05,319 --> 00:02:07,400
best friend in the Kingdom of Supedo...

8
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:08,360
is you, right?

9
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:10,759
I don't want to do anything

10
00:02:10,759 --> 00:02:12,719
to anyone else in the hospital.

11
00:02:13,280 --> 00:02:16,159
I just want to wait until his surgery succeeds,

12
00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:18,360
and get from Xavier

13
00:02:18,800 --> 00:02:20,240
all the bank investment plans

14
00:02:20,240 --> 00:02:21,639
backing his campaign.

15
00:02:22,080 --> 00:02:23,080
I don't really care

16
00:02:23,080 --> 00:02:25,360
what kind of friendship you two share.

17
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:27,000
In other words,

18
00:02:27,319 --> 00:02:28,479
this incident

19
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:30,840
doesn't have to involve

20
00:02:30,840 --> 00:02:31,840
anyone from the Kingdom of Supedo.

21
00:02:34,199 --> 00:02:36,439
I can leave the hospital untouched,

22
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:41,639
or I can stop your friend's surgery.

23
00:02:43,120 --> 00:02:44,439
You know what you have to do, right?

24
00:02:44,439 --> 00:02:45,879
You dare threaten me?

25
00:02:47,599 --> 00:02:49,360
You don't have to do anything.

26
00:02:50,039 --> 00:02:51,479
I just want to let you know,

27
00:02:51,960 --> 00:02:54,599
if I see in this hospital

28
00:02:54,599 --> 00:02:56,599
any police from Antilocaris

29
00:02:57,039 --> 00:02:58,680
or soldiers from Supedo—

30
00:02:59,520 --> 00:03:01,120
even just one—

31
00:03:01,599 --> 00:03:02,360
I'll expose your trafficking

32
00:03:02,360 --> 00:03:04,080
in arms and narcotics.

33
00:03:04,360 --> 00:03:05,159
Of course,

34
00:03:05,719 --> 00:03:06,919
once the surgery succeeds,

35
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:08,240
if I don't get

36
00:03:08,240 --> 00:03:09,960
the investment plans I want,

37
00:03:11,439 --> 00:03:12,759
then I'll have to trouble you

38
00:03:12,759 --> 00:03:14,520
to ask Xavier for me.

39
00:03:18,159 --> 00:03:19,319
You bastard!

40
00:04:14,120 --> 00:04:15,240
Team One to Point A.

41
00:04:15,240 --> 00:04:16,399
Team Two to Point B.

42
00:04:16,399 --> 00:04:17,439
Team Three to Point C.

43
00:04:17,439 --> 00:04:18,680
Report in immediately upon arrival.

44
00:04:22,839 --> 00:04:24,079
Not a bad setup.

45
00:04:27,360 --> 00:04:28,560
Head back to the second floor.

46
00:05:01,319 --> 00:05:02,480
I need to go to the bathroom.

47
00:05:02,800 --> 00:05:03,639
Me too.

48
00:05:04,319 --> 00:05:05,240
I can't hold it anymore.

49
00:05:06,959 --> 00:05:09,519
Fine. Don't pull any tricks on me.

50
00:05:39,480 --> 00:05:40,360
Quick, hurry!

51
00:05:49,920 --> 00:05:50,800
What's the situation?

52
00:05:51,800 --> 00:05:52,680
There are five hitmen.

53
00:05:52,680 --> 00:05:53,680
One's down.

54
00:05:53,680 --> 00:05:54,519
There should be four left.

55
00:05:55,600 --> 00:05:56,120
Then right now,

56
00:05:56,120 --> 00:05:57,519
should we get the hostages out first?

57
00:05:57,519 --> 00:05:58,120
No.

58
00:05:58,360 --> 00:06:00,120
Any chaos will disrupt the surgery.

59
00:06:00,680 --> 00:06:01,519
It's up to us

60
00:06:01,839 --> 00:06:03,680
to take out the militants.

61
00:06:04,040 --> 00:06:05,279
But when I fought them earlier,

62
00:06:05,279 --> 00:06:06,439
I didn't have the upper hand at all.

63
00:06:07,319 --> 00:06:09,079
Too bad local law dictates that

64
00:06:09,079 --> 00:06:10,480
foreign security companies like ours

65
00:06:10,720 --> 00:06:11,920
cannot use firearms.

66
00:06:14,959 --> 00:06:15,759
Shen Yu.

67
00:06:16,639 --> 00:06:17,680
This is a hospital.

68
00:06:18,439 --> 00:06:19,040
Right.

69
00:06:19,399 --> 00:06:20,920
We can turn tools from the OR

70
00:06:20,920 --> 00:06:22,079
into our weapons.

71
00:06:22,279 --> 00:06:23,399
We won't need guns.

72
00:06:24,600 --> 00:06:25,240
Alright.

73
00:06:25,240 --> 00:06:26,360
Let's go. Come on.

74
00:06:46,160 --> 00:06:48,000
From security footage near the hospital,

75
00:06:48,279 --> 00:06:49,879
a unit is approaching.

76
00:06:52,399 --> 00:06:55,120
Seems Walter still isn't taking chances.

77
00:06:55,639 --> 00:06:57,680
I can't see inside the hospital from here.

78
00:06:57,879 --> 00:06:59,560
It's sealed off completely.

79
00:06:59,839 --> 00:07:01,480
If they decide to make a move,

80
00:07:01,920 --> 00:07:04,399
they'll likely risk the hostages' lives.

81
00:07:05,319 --> 00:07:06,160
As of now, the rescue operation

82
00:07:06,160 --> 00:07:07,360
is under our tactical unit's command.

83
00:07:07,360 --> 00:07:09,120
Police, please assist with the lockdown.

84
00:07:09,120 --> 00:07:10,439
Sergeant Theodore, get ready.

85
00:07:10,439 --> 00:07:11,079
Yes, sir!

86
00:07:11,160 --> 00:07:13,240
About-face, move out!

87
00:08:59,960 --> 00:09:00,759
All right.

88
00:09:20,240 --> 00:09:20,759
Move.

89
00:09:25,720 --> 00:09:26,840
General Walter,

90
00:09:27,440 --> 00:09:28,919
I see your men.

91
00:09:30,279 --> 00:09:31,480
I just remembered...

92
00:09:31,639 --> 00:09:33,799
I only told you about the hostages,

93
00:09:34,080 --> 00:09:35,200
but didn't mention

94
00:09:35,360 --> 00:09:37,000
that in every corner of the hospital,

95
00:09:37,720 --> 00:09:39,639
I've planted bombs.

96
00:09:40,840 --> 00:09:42,399
Or maybe you just don't care

97
00:09:42,399 --> 00:09:44,000
who dies here,

98
00:09:45,360 --> 00:09:47,360
which is why you had your men rush in.

99
00:09:49,080 --> 00:09:51,000
But I'll leave behind clues

100
00:09:52,919 --> 00:09:54,440
so the Supedo government

101
00:09:54,840 --> 00:09:56,159
knows for certain

102
00:09:56,279 --> 00:09:59,360
that you're directly tied to this.

103
00:09:59,799 --> 00:10:03,840
Tell your men to be good and stay put.

104
00:10:13,399 --> 00:10:14,639
Issue your next order.

105
00:10:14,840 --> 00:10:15,399
All right.

106
00:10:37,039 --> 00:10:38,879
The police and military are both here.

107
00:10:44,480 --> 00:10:45,960
Captain, it's me, Wei Tian.

108
00:10:46,559 --> 00:10:47,720
We're with Zhong'an's team

109
00:10:47,720 --> 00:10:48,679
inside the hospital.

110
00:10:48,840 --> 00:10:49,879
What's the situation in there?

111
00:10:49,879 --> 00:10:50,919
I think the military

112
00:10:50,919 --> 00:10:52,159
was sent by Walter.

113
00:10:52,159 --> 00:10:52,879
And Zhong'an

114
00:10:52,879 --> 00:10:54,519
was secretly hired by them, too.

115
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:56,120
As for Xavier's surgery,

116
00:10:56,120 --> 00:10:57,720
it'll take another hour to finish.

117
00:10:58,000 --> 00:10:59,679
There are terrorists inside the hospital.

118
00:11:00,120 --> 00:11:02,039
I need some time with Zhong'an's team

119
00:11:02,039 --> 00:11:03,240
to take them down together.

120
00:11:03,399 --> 00:11:04,600
Then I'll let you know

121
00:11:04,600 --> 00:11:05,840
so you can let the police in.

122
00:11:06,039 --> 00:11:07,559
Alright. Take care.

123
00:11:12,840 --> 00:11:14,000
Good thing there's anesthesia.

124
00:12:12,039 --> 00:12:12,799
What's the situation?

125
00:12:12,799 --> 00:12:13,960
Besides the two on the fifth floor,

126
00:12:14,080 --> 00:12:15,120
there's another one on the fourth.

127
00:12:16,200 --> 00:12:16,639
Come on.

128
00:12:17,240 --> 00:12:17,679
Come on.

129
00:12:42,159 --> 00:12:43,320
Who's there?

130
00:12:44,759 --> 00:12:45,559
Stand up.

131
00:12:50,480 --> 00:12:51,639
What are you doing here?

132
00:12:51,960 --> 00:12:52,679
I took a wrong turn.

133
00:12:52,679 --> 00:12:53,559
Hurry up and come out.

134
00:13:14,240 --> 00:13:16,759
Shen Yu, go downstairs and keep watch.

135
00:13:17,240 --> 00:13:18,960
Leave the two upstairs to us.

136
00:13:22,840 --> 00:13:23,399
Let's go.

137
00:13:31,120 --> 00:13:31,919
Uncle Qu,

138
00:13:32,200 --> 00:13:33,600
the mastermind behind this incident

139
00:13:33,600 --> 00:13:35,720
is likely Xavier's rival in Country A.

140
00:13:35,960 --> 00:13:37,480
The goal, before the election,

141
00:13:37,639 --> 00:13:39,480
is to completely cut off Xavier's funding.

142
00:13:40,200 --> 00:13:42,240
Xavier came to Antilocaris this time

143
00:13:42,519 --> 00:13:43,799
and met with Walter.

144
00:13:44,000 --> 00:13:45,399
And they met in secret.

145
00:13:45,919 --> 00:13:46,759
Between the two of them,

146
00:13:46,879 --> 00:13:48,840
there's likely some dark secret.

147
00:13:49,600 --> 00:13:51,480
Got it. Keep investigating.

148
00:13:52,120 --> 00:13:52,919
Copy that.

149
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:01,080
Who would've thought

150
00:14:01,600 --> 00:14:03,159
Walter was such a coward,

151
00:14:03,360 --> 00:14:05,440
falling in line so obediently?

152
00:14:06,639 --> 00:14:08,919
How capable do you think Xavier really is,

153
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:10,320
to sway such powerful forces?

154
00:14:10,320 --> 00:14:12,039
Now we just wait for him to wake up

155
00:14:12,039 --> 00:14:13,759
and force him to hand over the list.

156
00:14:16,000 --> 00:14:17,799
We haven't received an emergency call,

157
00:14:18,200 --> 00:14:19,720
so the surgery must be going smoothly.

158
00:14:19,720 --> 00:14:22,080
Why have they all gone silent?

159
00:14:26,240 --> 00:14:27,360
I'll go check.

160
00:14:29,840 --> 00:14:32,120
If I don't contact you within ten minutes,

161
00:14:32,480 --> 00:14:33,840
stop the surgery immediately.

162
00:14:34,080 --> 00:14:34,879
Understood.

163
00:15:17,200 --> 00:15:18,399
That guy just went downstairs.

164
00:15:18,399 --> 00:15:19,360
I'm going down to back up Shen Yu.

165
00:15:19,360 --> 00:15:20,399
I'm leaving this to you.

166
00:15:20,679 --> 00:15:21,480
Got it.

167
00:16:27,960 --> 00:16:28,440
Let's go.

168
00:16:31,960 --> 00:16:33,600
After decades of exploration,

169
00:16:33,720 --> 00:16:35,519
the African continent has embarked on

170
00:16:35,519 --> 00:16:38,159
a path of self-reliance and unified growth.

171
00:16:38,480 --> 00:16:40,720
Xavier's hostage situation at the hospital

172
00:16:40,720 --> 00:16:41,919
was not an isolated incident.

173
00:16:41,919 --> 00:16:43,559
It reflects the instability

174
00:16:43,559 --> 00:16:45,279
that African nations face

175
00:16:45,279 --> 00:16:46,919
amidst rapid development.

176
00:16:47,360 --> 00:16:49,559
This undeniably poses a serious challenge

177
00:16:49,559 --> 00:16:51,720
to the overseas security sector.

178
00:16:52,159 --> 00:16:52,960
Therefore,

179
00:16:52,960 --> 00:16:54,600
Zhong'an must not only learn from

180
00:16:54,600 --> 00:16:57,000
the best models of overseas security firms,

181
00:16:57,120 --> 00:16:58,200
but also actively team up with

182
00:16:58,200 --> 00:16:59,960
local African security forces

183
00:16:59,960 --> 00:17:02,240
to build long-term strategic plans.

184
00:17:02,240 --> 00:17:02,919
Hello.

185
00:17:02,919 --> 00:17:04,960
We've subdued the terrorists.

186
00:17:05,400 --> 00:17:07,319
We'll leave the rest inside to you.

187
00:17:11,839 --> 00:17:12,960
Glad everyone's safe.

188
00:17:12,960 --> 00:17:13,759
Yes.

189
00:17:19,839 --> 00:17:20,640
Where's Xavier?

190
00:17:21,279 --> 00:17:23,200
Xavier's surgery isn't finished yet.

191
00:17:24,000 --> 00:17:25,200
Didn't get to use this, huh?

192
00:17:26,039 --> 00:17:26,880
Didn't need to.

193
00:17:27,519 --> 00:17:29,200
Looking sharp in that outfit.

194
00:17:29,720 --> 00:17:30,680
I think so too.

195
00:17:32,720 --> 00:17:34,559
Walter received a mandatory order.

196
00:17:34,559 --> 00:17:36,680
What exactly does Xavier have?

197
00:17:37,880 --> 00:17:38,759
I don't know either.

198
00:17:39,319 --> 00:17:41,160
Judging by Xavier's surgery,

199
00:17:41,200 --> 00:17:43,200
our surroundings are quite hostile,

200
00:17:43,440 --> 00:17:45,079
and the situation is highly volatile.

201
00:17:45,559 --> 00:17:46,559
Give it some time.

202
00:17:47,079 --> 00:17:49,640
The mastermind will surface eventually.

203
00:17:51,400 --> 00:17:52,680
What a pity.

204
00:17:53,640 --> 00:17:56,319
The big show ended so quickly.

205
00:17:58,119 --> 00:18:00,519
Wei Tian, Douglas...

206
00:18:01,440 --> 00:18:05,359
our game has only just begun.

207
00:18:11,519 --> 00:18:13,440
This is Helen from Zhong'an.

208
00:18:13,960 --> 00:18:16,680
She's a key figure close to Mr. Xiang.

209
00:18:17,319 --> 00:18:18,119
Hello.

210
00:18:18,319 --> 00:18:19,559
I'm from Zhong'an Special Ops,

211
00:18:19,559 --> 00:18:20,640
Team Leader Helen.

212
00:18:21,160 --> 00:18:22,319
Just call me Captain.

213
00:18:23,759 --> 00:18:24,680
The two of us represent Mr. Xiang

214
00:18:24,680 --> 00:18:25,799
in treating you both to a meal.

215
00:18:26,319 --> 00:18:27,359
Zhong'an is new here,

216
00:18:27,359 --> 00:18:28,920
and hope for Silent Protectors' support.

217
00:18:29,480 --> 00:18:30,599
Young Mr. Xiang has to give

218
00:18:30,599 --> 00:18:31,599
a special report to headquarters,

219
00:18:32,039 --> 00:18:33,759
so he urged us to host you properly.

220
00:18:34,920 --> 00:18:36,480
Come on, cheers!

221
00:18:38,440 --> 00:18:39,279
Thank you.

222
00:18:39,880 --> 00:18:40,400
Thanks.

223
00:18:41,599 --> 00:18:44,319
Wei Tian, thank you so much for this.

224
00:18:44,599 --> 00:18:45,799
I have to leave tonight.

225
00:18:45,880 --> 00:18:47,720
Mr. Xiang gave me another assignment.

226
00:18:48,039 --> 00:18:48,839
Take care.

227
00:18:49,279 --> 00:18:50,200
You take care too.

228
00:19:06,319 --> 00:19:07,119
Anda,

229
00:19:07,400 --> 00:19:08,319
I know of a security firm

230
00:19:08,319 --> 00:19:09,559
called Zhong'an,

231
00:19:09,599 --> 00:19:11,000
run by our fellow Chinese.

232
00:19:11,400 --> 00:19:13,319
Why don't you check with them?

233
00:19:15,279 --> 00:19:17,400
Can you really not protect me?

234
00:19:19,640 --> 00:19:20,720
Back in 2008,

235
00:19:20,720 --> 00:19:21,559
17 countries

236
00:19:21,559 --> 00:19:22,440
jointly signed

237
00:19:22,440 --> 00:19:23,440
the Montreux Document.

238
00:19:23,759 --> 00:19:24,680
It stipulates that

239
00:19:24,680 --> 00:19:25,880
private security companies

240
00:19:25,880 --> 00:19:27,680
must abide by local laws and obligations,

241
00:19:27,680 --> 00:19:28,839
including not carrying firearms.

242
00:19:28,920 --> 00:19:29,839
If you need to conduct

243
00:19:29,839 --> 00:19:31,039
high-risk business negotiations,

244
00:19:31,039 --> 00:19:31,839
we can commission

245
00:19:31,839 --> 00:19:32,720
a local security company

246
00:19:32,720 --> 00:19:34,160
to provide you with personal protection.

247
00:19:34,960 --> 00:19:35,759
Then...

248
00:19:35,880 --> 00:19:36,799
could you hire

249
00:19:36,799 --> 00:19:38,200
a Chinese person to protect me?

250
00:19:38,519 --> 00:19:40,400
I'm sorry, there's nothing we can do.

251
00:19:59,519 --> 00:20:00,319
Freeze!

252
00:20:10,640 --> 00:20:11,720
Traveling out here all alone?

253
00:20:11,720 --> 00:20:12,720
You're awfully brave.

254
00:20:12,720 --> 00:20:13,519
That's not it.

255
00:20:13,640 --> 00:20:15,799
My company's here. I got transferred.

256
00:20:17,119 --> 00:20:18,799
Still, you need to stay alert.

257
00:20:18,799 --> 00:20:20,240
You're in a foreign country, after all.

258
00:20:21,000 --> 00:20:22,480
You think I don't know that?

259
00:20:22,480 --> 00:20:24,680
You think I wanted to come to this dump?

260
00:20:24,880 --> 00:20:26,720
I can't even find anyone to protect me.

261
00:20:26,720 --> 00:20:28,160
You think I'm not scared?

262
00:20:28,519 --> 00:20:31,160
Fine, fine, whatever you say.

263
00:20:32,799 --> 00:20:34,359
Since we're both Chinese,

264
00:20:34,759 --> 00:20:36,880
if you're ever in danger, call me.

265
00:20:37,559 --> 00:20:38,400
Here's my card.

266
00:20:40,960 --> 00:20:43,119
No need. Useless company.

267
00:21:16,039 --> 00:21:16,599
Mr. Xiang.

268
00:21:20,400 --> 00:21:20,920
Mr. Xiang.

269
00:21:31,759 --> 00:21:32,880
On my way here,

270
00:21:33,079 --> 00:21:34,519
I ran into a Chinese girl.

271
00:21:34,960 --> 00:21:36,319
She saw our company's business card

272
00:21:36,319 --> 00:21:37,559
and tossed it right away.

273
00:21:38,279 --> 00:21:39,079
Lately,

274
00:21:39,240 --> 00:21:40,920
none of you upset a Chinese girl, right?

275
00:21:42,200 --> 00:21:43,440
A girl came to see me earlier,

276
00:21:43,440 --> 00:21:44,559
wanting to hire our security.

277
00:21:44,720 --> 00:21:45,680
But I turned her down.

278
00:21:45,680 --> 00:21:47,039
Why did you reject her request?

279
00:21:47,039 --> 00:21:48,440
Where she's heading

280
00:21:48,640 --> 00:21:50,680
is likely an area where militants operate.

281
00:21:51,200 --> 00:21:52,640
We're contracted employees now,

282
00:21:52,640 --> 00:21:53,599
not mercenaries.

283
00:21:54,119 --> 00:21:54,880
In this country,

284
00:21:54,880 --> 00:21:56,440
carrying weapons is strictly prohibited.

285
00:21:57,440 --> 00:21:58,240
When the time comes,

286
00:21:58,440 --> 00:21:59,519
never mind protecting her—

287
00:21:59,519 --> 00:22:01,160
our own safety would be on the line.

288
00:22:04,839 --> 00:22:06,279
Is there really no other way?

289
00:22:06,640 --> 00:22:08,240
We can only comply with local laws.

290
00:22:09,359 --> 00:22:10,359
However, I recommended

291
00:22:10,359 --> 00:22:11,519
a local security company to her.

292
00:22:11,720 --> 00:22:13,000
They can escort clients armed.

293
00:22:13,359 --> 00:22:14,599
Hopefully that helps her.

294
00:22:15,519 --> 00:22:16,240
I have serious doubts

295
00:22:16,240 --> 00:22:18,400
if local security firms in Antilocaris

296
00:22:18,400 --> 00:22:20,359
can truly protect Chinese people.

297
00:22:21,480 --> 00:22:22,680
Every one of you has been a soldier,

298
00:22:23,279 --> 00:22:24,119
enlisted in the army,

299
00:22:24,559 --> 00:22:25,680
and been through trials.

300
00:22:27,200 --> 00:22:28,519
Choosing Zhong'an

301
00:22:28,720 --> 00:22:31,000
is our greatest honor and pride.

302
00:22:31,279 --> 00:22:32,359
On behalf of Zhong'an,

303
00:22:32,920 --> 00:22:34,319
I thank you all.

304
00:22:35,880 --> 00:22:37,000
But you must know,

305
00:22:38,000 --> 00:22:39,400
since you chose Zhong'an,

306
00:22:40,160 --> 00:22:41,559
we have to provide our clients

307
00:22:41,920 --> 00:22:43,839
with real security and protection,

308
00:22:45,119 --> 00:22:47,079
not just a paper contract.

309
00:22:47,559 --> 00:22:49,880
We must think further than our clients,

310
00:22:50,200 --> 00:22:51,079
and do better.

311
00:22:54,519 --> 00:22:55,440
Any grueling training,

312
00:22:55,440 --> 00:22:56,440
we can endure it.

313
00:22:57,039 --> 00:22:57,880
But what we can't do yet

314
00:22:58,279 --> 00:23:00,079
is figure out how, completely unarmed,

315
00:23:00,079 --> 00:23:02,079
to protect ourselves from armed criminals

316
00:23:02,079 --> 00:23:03,240
and keep our clients safe.

317
00:23:03,759 --> 00:23:04,920
We are a security company.

318
00:23:05,319 --> 00:23:06,119
Here,

319
00:23:06,400 --> 00:23:07,200
more than anything, we must

320
00:23:07,200 --> 00:23:08,119
obey local laws

321
00:23:08,119 --> 00:23:09,319
in order to survive.

322
00:23:09,920 --> 00:23:11,240
In Antilocaris,

323
00:23:11,559 --> 00:23:12,759
Zhong'an must become

324
00:23:12,759 --> 00:23:14,599
the rock and refuge for all Chinese here.

325
00:23:15,160 --> 00:23:16,039
That's why our training

326
00:23:16,519 --> 00:23:17,960
must meet the highest standards.

327
00:23:18,559 --> 00:23:19,480
Do you understand?

328
00:23:19,680 --> 00:23:20,200
Understood!

329
00:23:38,880 --> 00:23:40,680
The person we're protecting this time

330
00:23:40,680 --> 00:23:42,279
is a Japanese journalist, Xia Xue.

331
00:23:42,799 --> 00:23:44,039
She's 35 years old.

332
00:23:44,279 --> 00:23:45,240
She's really impressive.

333
00:23:45,279 --> 00:23:47,720
She won a Pulitzer Prize three years ago.

334
00:23:48,440 --> 00:23:49,400
Although she isn't affiliated with

335
00:23:49,400 --> 00:23:51,000
any media outlet or organization,

336
00:23:51,240 --> 00:23:53,680
she's always focused on digging up stories

337
00:23:53,759 --> 00:23:55,000
and exposing scandals.

338
00:23:55,640 --> 00:23:56,440
Understood.

339
00:23:57,519 --> 00:23:58,319
All right.

340
00:23:59,279 --> 00:24:00,400
Let's split up.

341
00:24:00,519 --> 00:24:01,200
See you later.

342
00:24:01,200 --> 00:24:01,839
Okay.

343
00:24:03,400 --> 00:24:06,119
Here, I have a document.

344
00:24:06,119 --> 00:24:07,119
Take it to the consulate,

345
00:24:07,119 --> 00:24:08,960
get it stamped, and bring it back.

346
00:24:12,000 --> 00:24:13,000
Stay safe.

347
00:24:13,400 --> 00:24:14,799
The Third District is very dangerous.

348
00:24:14,799 --> 00:24:15,720
Don't head that way.

349
00:24:18,400 --> 00:24:19,920
Rossi, look at this.

350
00:24:20,079 --> 00:24:21,960
The Japanese journalist wrote back.

351
00:24:22,359 --> 00:24:23,119
She said she's meeting someone

352
00:24:23,119 --> 00:24:24,799
at Paris Commerce Café.

353
00:24:25,079 --> 00:24:25,920
She wants to hire us

354
00:24:25,920 --> 00:24:27,920
to handle security for their meeting.

355
00:24:29,119 --> 00:24:30,319
I know about this.

356
00:24:31,319 --> 00:24:32,680
The one forced to flee to Kenya,

357
00:24:32,680 --> 00:24:33,759
that Japanese executive.

358
00:24:33,960 --> 00:24:35,319
He wants to expose

359
00:24:35,319 --> 00:24:36,400
a senior management sex bribery scandal.

360
00:24:37,400 --> 00:24:38,640
The Japanese journalist

361
00:24:38,720 --> 00:24:39,839
is someone he contacted himself.

362
00:24:42,359 --> 00:24:43,599
Does he have any other requests?

363
00:24:44,200 --> 00:24:45,119
He also asked that

364
00:24:45,559 --> 00:24:47,400
after meeting the Japanese journalist,

365
00:24:47,920 --> 00:24:49,640
he be safely escorted to the airport.

366
00:24:51,200 --> 00:24:52,039
Through a friend of mine,

367
00:24:52,039 --> 00:24:53,400
I contacted the airport police.

368
00:24:53,400 --> 00:24:55,000
They said they'll coordinate with us.

369
00:25:00,119 --> 00:25:00,799
Good.

370
00:25:02,279 --> 00:25:04,519
Then let's get ready.

371
00:25:05,160 --> 00:25:05,960
Okay.

372
00:25:18,000 --> 00:25:20,319
Pedestrians and vehicles around the hotel...

373
00:25:20,720 --> 00:25:22,319
No suspicious activity spotted.

374
00:25:29,599 --> 00:25:30,599
We're heading out now.

375
00:25:30,839 --> 00:25:32,640
We'll be at the entrance in three minutes.

376
00:25:32,640 --> 00:25:33,440
Copy that.

377
00:26:03,480 --> 00:26:04,640
Turn left in 200 meters

378
00:26:05,279 --> 00:26:06,440
to avoid the traffic.

379
00:26:06,440 --> 00:26:07,960
Guaranteed to be there in 20 minutes.

380
00:26:40,480 --> 00:26:42,359
Captain, Rossi.

381
00:26:42,759 --> 00:26:44,000
All clear on my end.

382
00:26:44,640 --> 00:26:47,000
Take the VIP to the rendezvous point.

383
00:26:47,200 --> 00:26:48,400
Copy that.

384
00:26:49,079 --> 00:26:49,480
Roger.

385
00:26:52,279 --> 00:26:52,759
Step out.

386
00:26:56,000 --> 00:26:56,319
Let's go.

387
00:27:05,839 --> 00:27:06,440
Please, have a seat.

388
00:27:11,200 --> 00:27:11,640
This way.

389
00:27:43,279 --> 00:27:45,440
Wei Tian, someone's stealing your bike!

390
00:27:59,440 --> 00:28:00,119
It's you.

391
00:28:00,119 --> 00:28:01,720
I've been looking for you. It's fine.

392
00:28:01,720 --> 00:28:03,640
I'm Anda from the Plato Hotel.

393
00:28:04,960 --> 00:28:05,759
Hello.

394
00:28:05,759 --> 00:28:06,440
Hello.

395
00:28:15,599 --> 00:28:16,359
Heads up, everyone.

396
00:28:16,359 --> 00:28:17,599
Something's off with that waiter.

397
00:28:29,240 --> 00:28:30,440
Move, hurry!

398
00:28:30,559 --> 00:28:31,480
What's the situation inside?

399
00:28:40,000 --> 00:28:40,960
The VIP is safe.

400
00:28:41,160 --> 00:28:41,559
Let's go.

401
00:28:48,319 --> 00:28:48,839
Boss.

402
00:28:50,480 --> 00:28:52,200
The hit failed. Someone rescued them.

403
00:28:53,039 --> 00:28:53,880
We blew it.

404
00:28:58,839 --> 00:29:02,119
Forget it. The exposure might be good.

405
00:29:02,720 --> 00:29:04,680
Watch this stock's movement tomorrow.

406
00:29:04,680 --> 00:29:06,119
We can still make a profit.

407
00:29:06,680 --> 00:29:07,200
Understood.

408
00:29:29,880 --> 00:29:30,880
All right, that's enough.

409
00:29:31,200 --> 00:29:33,440
A scratch like this is nothing.

410
00:29:34,039 --> 00:29:34,920
It's necessary.

411
00:29:36,000 --> 00:29:37,680
If it gets infected by other bacteria,

412
00:29:37,680 --> 00:29:38,880
it could be fatal.

413
00:29:40,880 --> 00:29:43,319
I've been looking for you for so long.

414
00:29:43,359 --> 00:29:44,440
I couldn't find you anywhere.

415
00:29:44,559 --> 00:29:46,039
I thought I'd never see you again.

416
00:29:46,039 --> 00:29:46,920
Why were you looking for me?

417
00:29:47,240 --> 00:29:48,920
It's dangerous here. Don't run around.

418
00:29:49,799 --> 00:29:50,960
About last time...

419
00:29:51,079 --> 00:29:51,799
I wanted to thank you.

420
00:29:59,680 --> 00:30:01,359
I've safely delivered him to the airport.

421
00:30:01,680 --> 00:30:03,839
Japanese police got him onto the plane.

422
00:30:03,920 --> 00:30:04,839
Don't worry.

423
00:30:04,960 --> 00:30:07,000
Good. Be careful on the way back.

424
00:30:07,000 --> 00:30:07,440
Will do.

425
00:30:10,000 --> 00:30:10,799
Also,

426
00:30:11,000 --> 00:30:11,799
I found out

427
00:30:11,799 --> 00:30:13,759
that you provide private security.

428
00:30:14,200 --> 00:30:15,640
So I wanted to ask,

429
00:30:15,640 --> 00:30:18,039
can you take my commission

430
00:30:18,039 --> 00:30:18,920
to protect me?

431
00:30:19,559 --> 00:30:20,599
I know how this works.

432
00:30:20,599 --> 00:30:22,400
I'll follow all your rules.

433
00:30:23,079 --> 00:30:25,000
Sure, no problem at all.

434
00:30:25,359 --> 00:30:27,200
200 dollars a day.

435
00:30:30,079 --> 00:30:30,880
Anda.

436
00:30:31,359 --> 00:30:33,319
Plato Hotel's top salesperson for 3 years.

437
00:30:33,319 --> 00:30:34,559
Type O blood, Pisces.

438
00:30:34,559 --> 00:30:35,599
25 years old.

439
00:30:36,119 --> 00:30:37,680
Transferred here just two weeks ago.

440
00:30:37,920 --> 00:30:38,720
Wei Tian,

441
00:30:38,920 --> 00:30:40,279
isn't she the foolish woman

442
00:30:40,279 --> 00:30:41,519
you rescued on your last mission?

443
00:30:42,359 --> 00:30:43,960
Hey, watch how you speak.

444
00:30:45,279 --> 00:30:46,359
It's very dangerous here.

445
00:30:46,359 --> 00:30:47,400
Today I even saw someone

446
00:30:47,400 --> 00:30:48,680
pull out a gun and kill someone.

447
00:30:49,519 --> 00:30:51,599
If you didn't hang around us,

448
00:30:51,599 --> 00:30:52,920
you wouldn't be in danger.

449
00:30:53,200 --> 00:30:54,200
So a place like this

450
00:30:54,200 --> 00:30:55,599
isn't somewhere an ordinary woman like you

451
00:30:55,599 --> 00:30:56,599
can just barge into whenever she likes.

452
00:30:56,599 --> 00:30:57,680
You'd better stay away from us.

453
00:31:00,440 --> 00:31:01,559
I'll pay the fee.

454
00:31:01,880 --> 00:31:03,240
Will you take my commission or not?

455
00:31:03,960 --> 00:31:05,200
Mission guaranteed.

456
00:31:07,640 --> 00:31:08,599
But,

457
00:31:08,880 --> 00:31:09,839
you must guarantee

458
00:31:09,839 --> 00:31:11,640
my safety in this country.

459
00:31:11,880 --> 00:31:12,839
And also,

460
00:31:13,240 --> 00:31:16,920
answer my calls anytime.

461
00:31:19,559 --> 00:31:20,599
If anything happens,

462
00:31:21,000 --> 00:31:22,240
you're the first person I'll contact.

463
00:31:23,279 --> 00:31:25,119
Call her. Call Sha Lan.

464
00:31:25,880 --> 00:31:27,960
Sha Lan signs the contract, not me.

465
00:31:46,039 --> 00:31:48,079
Come on, keep up!

466
00:32:50,160 --> 00:32:50,960
Open your mouth.

467
00:32:57,680 --> 00:32:58,480
How is it?

468
00:32:59,240 --> 00:33:01,240
Does it feel familiar?

469
00:33:01,279 --> 00:33:03,079
Bursting across your taste buds?

470
00:33:03,599 --> 00:33:06,400
Did a spark flash before your eyes?

471
00:33:12,880 --> 00:33:15,839
Rossi lost her memory from an explosion,

472
00:33:16,079 --> 00:33:18,480
not from damaged taste buds.

473
00:33:18,960 --> 00:33:20,240
No, you don't get it.

474
00:33:20,519 --> 00:33:21,559
In the human body,

475
00:33:21,640 --> 00:33:24,160
the tongue and mouth are most sensitive.

476
00:33:25,079 --> 00:33:26,519
Through this sense of touch,

477
00:33:26,880 --> 00:33:29,160
it can trigger plenty of memories.

478
00:33:29,160 --> 00:33:29,960
Exactly.

479
00:33:30,000 --> 00:33:31,559
Maybe it could even work a miracle.

480
00:33:34,079 --> 00:33:35,839
What is it? Did you remember something?

481
00:33:36,720 --> 00:33:37,200
What's wrong?

482
00:33:42,000 --> 00:33:42,960
Did you recall anything?

483
00:33:44,680 --> 00:33:45,480
Uncle Qu...

484
00:33:45,920 --> 00:33:47,680
Why did you put in so much chili?

485
00:33:49,079 --> 00:33:50,079
It's burning my mouth off!

486
00:33:50,319 --> 00:33:51,319
All that effort for nothing.

487
00:33:59,400 --> 00:34:00,200
Anda.

488
00:34:01,079 --> 00:34:01,720
Right here.

489
00:34:01,720 --> 00:34:03,319
This is the company's

490
00:34:03,319 --> 00:34:04,119
asset inventory in Antilocaris.

491
00:34:04,160 --> 00:34:07,000
It includes lease contracts, agreements,

492
00:34:07,039 --> 00:34:07,960
and various invoices.

493
00:34:08,000 --> 00:34:09,000
Sort them out and hand them to me.

494
00:34:10,360 --> 00:34:12,159
Besides running our hotel,

495
00:34:12,159 --> 00:34:13,599
any other businesses I need to manage?

496
00:34:13,599 --> 00:34:14,280
Yeah.

497
00:34:14,719 --> 00:34:16,159
Our crane rental business

498
00:34:16,159 --> 00:34:17,960
is one of our main sources of income here.

499
00:34:18,320 --> 00:34:19,639
You're new to Africa, so you don't know,

500
00:34:20,159 --> 00:34:22,000
but infrastructure equipment here

501
00:34:22,000 --> 00:34:23,000
is in critically short supply.

502
00:34:23,199 --> 00:34:25,480
Same for workshops and warehouses.

503
00:34:25,480 --> 00:34:25,920
In any case,

504
00:34:25,920 --> 00:34:27,480
the rental business is extremely busy.

505
00:34:28,280 --> 00:34:29,199
Look over them carefully.

506
00:34:29,199 --> 00:34:29,800
As for the dates on them,

507
00:34:29,800 --> 00:34:31,039
whatever you do, don't mix them up.

508
00:34:45,880 --> 00:34:47,679
Alright, I'll go right now.

509
00:34:49,519 --> 00:34:51,079
Anda, Anda, what's wrong?

510
00:34:51,400 --> 00:34:53,679
Well, a local factory...

511
00:34:53,679 --> 00:34:55,400
Their manager just called

512
00:34:55,440 --> 00:34:57,360
and said they had a collapse,

513
00:34:57,400 --> 00:34:59,079
and many workers are trapped inside.

514
00:34:59,079 --> 00:35:00,559
They want us to send a crane

515
00:35:00,599 --> 00:35:01,480
over to rescue them.

516
00:35:01,519 --> 00:35:02,559
No, no, no, wait.

517
00:35:03,000 --> 00:35:04,480
Does Mr. Xiao know about this?

518
00:35:04,480 --> 00:35:05,559
Mr. Xiao went out.

519
00:35:05,559 --> 00:35:07,000
He won't be back until tonight.

520
00:35:07,119 --> 00:35:07,880
It'll be too late!

521
00:35:07,880 --> 00:35:09,000
No, listen, think about it.

522
00:35:09,360 --> 00:35:10,480
Right now, you don't even know

523
00:35:10,480 --> 00:35:11,639
why the factory collapsed.

524
00:35:11,920 --> 00:35:13,360
Sending a crane out right now

525
00:35:13,360 --> 00:35:14,239
is too reckless.

526
00:35:15,599 --> 00:35:16,599
All those workers...

527
00:35:16,599 --> 00:35:18,079
are we just going to leave them to die?

528
00:35:19,920 --> 00:35:20,719
How about this?

529
00:35:22,159 --> 00:35:23,360
First, call the security company

530
00:35:23,360 --> 00:35:25,039
and ask what's going on.

531
00:35:25,280 --> 00:35:26,079
How about that?

532
00:35:26,440 --> 00:35:27,559
Is that really necessary?

533
00:35:28,119 --> 00:35:29,360
Just call like I told you.

534
00:35:29,519 --> 00:35:30,800
Who takes the blame if things go wrong?

535
00:35:41,480 --> 00:35:42,320
It's Anda.

536
00:35:42,960 --> 00:35:44,000
I know it's you.

537
00:35:44,119 --> 00:35:44,920
What's wrong?

538
00:35:45,800 --> 00:35:47,960
Just now, a factory

539
00:35:47,960 --> 00:35:50,519
director called and said

540
00:35:51,119 --> 00:35:52,480
there was a collapse,

541
00:35:52,480 --> 00:35:54,920
and many workers are trapped.

542
00:35:55,000 --> 00:35:56,760
He wants us to send a crane over.

543
00:35:56,760 --> 00:35:57,719
Can we go?

544
00:36:02,760 --> 00:36:04,000
Anda just called and said

545
00:36:04,000 --> 00:36:05,440
the food factory collapsed,

546
00:36:05,440 --> 00:36:06,559
and they want Plato Hotel

547
00:36:06,559 --> 00:36:08,039
to send a crane to help rescue them.

548
00:36:10,239 --> 00:36:11,119
Tell her

549
00:36:11,880 --> 00:36:14,280
the factory owner offended the militants.

550
00:36:14,679 --> 00:36:16,599
If Plato Hotel sends a crane,

551
00:36:16,679 --> 00:36:18,800
the logo on it will expose our identity.

552
00:36:19,079 --> 00:36:20,159
Then Plato Hotel

553
00:36:20,159 --> 00:36:21,440
will become the militants'

554
00:36:21,440 --> 00:36:22,760
target for their next attack.

555
00:36:23,199 --> 00:36:24,000
All right, understood.

556
00:36:38,239 --> 00:36:39,039
Anda,

557
00:36:39,280 --> 00:36:41,079
we absolutely cannot lend out this crane!

558
00:36:41,079 --> 00:36:42,079
We cannot lend it!

559
00:36:43,360 --> 00:36:43,679
But...

560
00:36:51,719 --> 00:36:52,519
Manager,

561
00:36:54,960 --> 00:36:57,199
there's really nothing we can do here.

562
00:37:06,800 --> 00:37:08,719
There are so many workers there!

563
00:37:08,800 --> 00:37:10,760
Are we really gonna just watch them die?

564
00:37:11,039 --> 00:37:12,079
That text you got earlier

565
00:37:12,079 --> 00:37:13,239
made it very clear.

566
00:37:13,440 --> 00:37:14,880
If we send out the crane now,

567
00:37:15,079 --> 00:37:16,880
the company will soon become

568
00:37:16,880 --> 00:37:17,760
a target for armed militants!

569
00:37:17,760 --> 00:37:19,920
Who will answer for our lives then?

570
00:37:20,679 --> 00:37:22,239
Then we'll cover up

571
00:37:22,239 --> 00:37:24,000
the company logo on the crane,

572
00:37:24,159 --> 00:37:26,199
and we'll use a local driver instead!

573
00:37:26,599 --> 00:37:28,199
No, absolutely not!

574
00:37:28,360 --> 00:37:29,920
I'm telling you, we can't lend this crane!

575
00:37:29,920 --> 00:37:30,440
I don't approve!

576
00:37:33,320 --> 00:37:33,960
Tell me,

577
00:37:34,400 --> 00:37:36,280
what if it were our company,

578
00:37:36,280 --> 00:37:37,880
and those were our own workers trapped?

579
00:37:37,880 --> 00:37:38,519
Would you just stand by?

580
00:37:42,199 --> 00:37:43,000
Anda,

581
00:37:43,840 --> 00:37:44,960
in this country,

582
00:37:44,960 --> 00:37:46,519
we only need to remember one thing:

583
00:37:46,800 --> 00:37:48,679
protect ourselves and avoid danger.

584
00:37:48,679 --> 00:37:49,440
Do you understand?

585
00:37:52,400 --> 00:37:53,360
I...

586
00:37:54,920 --> 00:37:57,480
will make sure the logo is fully covered!

587
00:37:58,199 --> 00:37:59,519
Anda, come back! You can't go!

588
00:37:59,519 --> 00:38:00,039
Anda!

589
00:38:10,079 --> 00:38:10,599
Slow down.

590
00:38:14,280 --> 00:38:14,760
Be careful.

591
00:38:34,039 --> 00:38:35,280
Look over there!

592
00:38:35,480 --> 00:38:37,159
Someone's hurt over there!

593
00:38:38,360 --> 00:38:39,000
Watch out!

594
00:38:49,039 --> 00:38:49,880
Oh no, oh no!

595
00:38:49,960 --> 00:38:51,159
Oh no, oh no, oh no!

596
00:39:07,639 --> 00:39:09,000
When I first got here,

597
00:39:09,000 --> 00:39:10,639
I knew this place was trouble.

598
00:39:11,719 --> 00:39:13,239
It sure is lively out there now.

599
00:39:15,320 --> 00:39:16,000
Where's Anda?

600
00:39:17,079 --> 00:39:17,960
Mr. Xiao, Mr. Xiao!

601
00:39:18,320 --> 00:39:21,760
Anda? Hasn't Anda come back yet?

602
00:39:22,000 --> 00:39:23,679
What? Still not back?

603
00:39:24,519 --> 00:39:26,320
As if she doesn't stand out enough!

604
00:39:26,320 --> 00:39:27,559
Hurry up and tell her to come back!

605
00:39:27,920 --> 00:39:28,599
Right away!

606
00:39:39,800 --> 00:39:40,480
Yang Di.

607
00:39:42,280 --> 00:39:42,960
Got it.

608
00:39:43,119 --> 00:39:44,280
Tell Mr. Xiao...

609
00:39:44,280 --> 00:39:46,159
I... I'm off to meet a client!

610
00:39:46,960 --> 00:39:48,119
Mr. Xiao's asking if you're with...

611
00:39:51,039 --> 00:39:51,800
I can't hear you!

612
00:40:17,519 --> 00:40:18,199
What happened?

613
00:40:23,880 --> 00:40:25,159
The staff dorm was bombed.

614
00:40:25,960 --> 00:40:27,519
Sha Lan, activate the contingency plan?

615
00:40:27,800 --> 00:40:29,519
No need. Luckily, there are no casualties.

616
00:40:34,800 --> 00:40:36,360
Where are you going? We have a mission.

617
00:40:36,800 --> 00:40:37,440
Just for a walk.

618
00:40:45,840 --> 00:40:46,920
Thank you for your cooperation.

619
00:40:46,920 --> 00:40:47,800
Based on the scene,

620
00:40:47,800 --> 00:40:49,480
we can confirm it was a terrorist attack.

621
00:40:49,480 --> 00:40:50,440
As for any other details,

622
00:40:50,440 --> 00:40:51,719
further investigation is required.

623
00:40:51,960 --> 00:40:52,760
I'm sorry.

624
00:40:52,760 --> 00:40:53,920
Due to the confined space,

625
00:40:53,920 --> 00:40:55,719
the damage is extremely severe.

626
00:40:55,920 --> 00:40:57,360
Most items are unrecognizable.

627
00:40:57,360 --> 00:40:58,840
So far, we've only found this.

628
00:40:58,840 --> 00:40:59,880
Hope it helps.

629
00:41:01,679 --> 00:41:03,559
Is... is that it?

630
00:41:03,679 --> 00:41:05,199
We'll contact you if necessary.

631
00:41:05,480 --> 00:41:07,079
Th-This is a terrorist attack!

632
00:41:07,159 --> 00:41:07,960
I'm sorry.

633
00:41:08,239 --> 00:41:09,239
There are too many bombings like this.

634
00:41:09,559 --> 00:41:10,360
We've already notified

635
00:41:10,360 --> 00:41:11,880
your employer and the Chinese embassy.

636
00:41:11,920 --> 00:41:13,000
If you need anything,

637
00:41:13,000 --> 00:41:14,039
feel free to contact us anytime.

638
00:41:15,719 --> 00:41:16,039
Wait...

639
00:41:16,559 --> 00:41:17,360
No...

640
00:41:17,360 --> 00:41:19,599
This... this is completely outrageous!

641
00:41:20,519 --> 00:41:21,320
No, no.

642
00:41:22,480 --> 00:41:23,320
I'm fine.

643
00:41:24,599 --> 00:41:25,599
Understood, Mr. Xiao.

644
00:41:50,159 --> 00:41:50,920
Do you have any idea

645
00:41:50,920 --> 00:41:53,000
how much trouble you caused the company?

646
00:41:54,079 --> 00:41:55,519
I know I was wrong.

647
00:41:57,519 --> 00:41:58,320
Do you have any idea

648
00:41:58,320 --> 00:42:00,079
who you're messing with?

649
00:42:02,119 --> 00:42:03,760
Even the UN peacekeeping forces

650
00:42:03,760 --> 00:42:05,199
wouldn't openly provoke them!

651
00:42:06,559 --> 00:42:09,719
Yet you took a vehicle without permission,

652
00:42:09,960 --> 00:42:11,320
and made such a huge scene!

653
00:42:12,239 --> 00:42:13,679
How am I supposed to explain this to them?

654
00:42:14,559 --> 00:42:16,840
I'll submit my resignation in person.

655
00:42:17,599 --> 00:42:18,400
Resign?

656
00:42:20,840 --> 00:42:22,719
You made such a huge mess,

657
00:42:23,639 --> 00:42:24,920
and now you just want to walk away?

658
00:42:25,519 --> 00:42:26,440
Listen, young lady.

659
00:42:26,760 --> 00:42:28,000
How can you be so irresponsible?

660
00:42:29,800 --> 00:42:30,480
I...

661
00:42:31,760 --> 00:42:34,239
I'll submit a report myself,

662
00:42:34,400 --> 00:42:35,960
detailing everything that happened,

663
00:42:35,960 --> 00:42:37,159
every single detail,

664
00:42:38,480 --> 00:42:39,480
and give it to the company

665
00:42:39,480 --> 00:42:40,599
to face whatever penalty they decide.

666
00:42:43,400 --> 00:42:44,119
Hello, sir.

667
00:42:44,119 --> 00:42:44,280
Hello.

668
00:42:44,280 --> 00:42:45,760
How may I help you?

669
00:42:45,920 --> 00:42:47,239
Is Miss Anda in?

670
00:42:47,800 --> 00:42:48,559
You're looking for Manager An?

671
00:42:48,559 --> 00:42:48,800
Yes.

672
00:42:48,800 --> 00:42:49,719
I'll call her.

673
00:42:49,719 --> 00:42:51,199
No need. Where is she?

674
00:42:51,239 --> 00:42:52,239
She's in her office.

675
00:42:52,760 --> 00:42:53,199
Thank you.

676
00:42:54,559 --> 00:42:55,360
Still,

677
00:42:56,360 --> 00:42:57,679
then again...

678
00:42:58,360 --> 00:42:59,920
The silver lining here is,

679
00:43:00,119 --> 00:43:01,639
thankfully, no one was hurt.

680
00:43:02,320 --> 00:43:03,440
You don't need to worry too much.

681
00:43:04,159 --> 00:43:05,400
I've got your back.

682
00:43:06,559 --> 00:43:08,079
Everyone knows

683
00:43:08,440 --> 00:43:10,559
I always look out for my own people.

684
00:43:11,199 --> 00:43:13,199
So I won't let you be wronged.

685
00:43:13,880 --> 00:43:15,199
Actually, about this matter,

686
00:43:15,800 --> 00:43:17,159
I've already reported it to headquarters.

687
00:43:18,159 --> 00:43:20,840
And besides, after all,

688
00:43:21,360 --> 00:43:23,719
this was an isolated terrorist attack.

689
00:43:24,199 --> 00:43:25,000
So...

690
00:43:25,280 --> 00:43:28,800
I've already submitted a request to HQ

691
00:43:28,800 --> 00:43:30,079
for new dormitories.

692
00:43:30,079 --> 00:43:33,079
So, Anda, about this...

693
00:43:33,079 --> 00:43:34,559
All right, I get it.

694
00:43:34,559 --> 00:43:35,639
I'll figure something out myself.
